<<!DOCTYPE type=`memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki` spec=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/memetic-wikitext`>>

<<^ code=`&#x0001;` from=`?` to=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.approval.opens`>>
<<^ code=`&#x0002;`>>

```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "sign an approval of one file's exact bytes with the seats here"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///realm.approval.opens", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.approval.opens"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.approval.opens"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.approval.opens ~ an approval opens over exact bytes

`lares nexus approve open <file> purpose=<p> surface=<s> [class=ordinary|high-impact] [nexus=<aid>] out=<approval>` reads the file's exact bytes, signs an approval of their hash with the seats held in this vault, prints the statement digest, and writes the approval file (public material alone).

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ open

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`open` params=`file/manifest.json purpose/floor-release surface/floor-release class/high-impact out/a.json ~ open a floor release approval`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ file · purpose · surface · class · nexus · out

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`file` params=`takes/host-path needs/required seat/1 as/<file> ~ the bytes approved`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`purpose` params=`takes/word needs/required ~ the purpose`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`surface` params=`takes/word needs/required ~ the surface`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`class` params=`takes/word ~ ordinary or high-impact`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`nexus` params=`takes/aid ~ the Nexus, by AID; absent, the primary charter's`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`out` params=`takes/host-path ~ the approval file`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ quorum

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`quorum` params=`who/hand key/seat ~ the seats held in this vault sign`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · vessel-composing · vessel-silent · vessel-locked · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[realm.approval.opens file/manifest.json purpose/floor-release surface/floor-release out/a.json]] ~ a missing file, purpose, surface or --out`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-composing` params=`~ an unlock still recomposes the vessel; run again once lares vault status reads ready`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-silent` params=`~ something holds the store and answers nothing; lares vessel read names the holder`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-locked` params=`~ the vessel key stands shut; lares vault unlock opens it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the store refused; the message names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ opened

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`opened` params=`exit/0 ~ the approval written and its statement digest`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares nexus approve open

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares nexus approve open]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~/ahu>>

